  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1)/(4)+(1)/(4 × 5) + (1)/(4 × 5 × 6)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1)/(4)+(1)/(4 × 5) + (1)/(4 × 5 × 6)\n\n⇒ 1/4 [1 + 1/5 + 1/(5 × 6)]\n\n⇒ 1/4[1 + 1/5 + 1/5 - 1/6] \n\n⇒ 1/4[1 + 2/5 - 1/6] \n\n⇒ 1/4[5/6 + 2/5] \n\n⇒ 1/4[(25 + 12)/30]\n\n⇒ 1/4 × 37/30 \n\n⇒ 37/120 \n\n⇒ 0.308\n\n⇒ 0.31\n\n**∴ The required result is 0.31.**",
